abstract: Static analysis for AI agent codebases that scores both agentic vulnerability
  patterns (unsafe eval/exec, shell injection, insecure deserialization) and quantum-readiness
  gaps (classical-only RSA/ECDSA/TLS with no post-quantum cryptography dependency) in a
  single scan.
